#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Beasts - Leviathan"
msgstr "野兽 - 深潜巨兽"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Summon as many beasts as possible after you get early [[Lurking Leviathan||130711]]. The best beast summoner is reborned [[Sewer lord||130996]]. Hoarding Hyena summons a taunt summon which is the next best. Then, paired with [[Banana Slamma||98824]], every summon will have a ton of attack."
msgstr "尽早获得 [[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] 后，尽可能多地召唤野兽。最好的野兽召唤组件是获得了复生的 [[Sewer lord||130996]]。其次是囤食土狼，它可以召唤一个具有嘲讽的随从。搭配 [[Banana Slamma||98824]] 后，每个召唤出来的随从都能获得大量攻击力。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Early [[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] + Beast summons ([[Sewer Lord||130996]])"
msgstr "早期获得[[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] + 野兽召唤([[Sewer Lord||130996]])"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Beast summons midgame (beetles)"
msgstr "野兽召唤中期过度（甲虫）"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Make huge attack summons"
msgstr "做出巨大的召唤物"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/2/
msgid "Mechs - Magnetics"
msgstr "机械 - 磁力"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/2/
msgid "With [[Spark Snapper||132676]], generate as many magnetics as possible so every magnet you play is huge. The best generation is [[Scrap Scraper||98592]]. Then, use [[Drone Duplicator||132312]] to duplicate a big magnetic a turn, preferable [[Accord-o-tron||98576]] for money."
msgstr "拥有 [[Spark Snapper||132676]] 后，尽可能多地生成磁力随从，使你使用的每个磁力随从都拥有大量属性。最好的生成组件是 [[Scrap Scraper||98592]]。随后，使用 [[Drone Duplicator||132312]] 每回合复制一个大型磁力随从。为了获得额外经济，最好复制 [[Accord-o-tron||98576]]。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/2/
msgid "Magnetic Generation ([[Scrap Scraper||98592]]) + [[Spark Snapper||132676]]"
msgstr "磁力生成 ([[Scrap Scraper||98592]]) + [[Spark Snapper||132676]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/2/
msgid "Magnetic Generation ([[Scrap Scraper||98592]])"
msgstr "磁力生成 ([[Scrap Scraper||98592]])"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/2/
msgid "Magnetize huge mechs"
msgstr "磁力强化巨型机械"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "Mechs - Magnetics/Spells"
msgstr "机械 - 磁力/法术"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "Put targetted spells on mechs as much as possible with [[Glambot||132893]] on board. [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] doubles the effect. Best to have spell generation such as [[Captain Cookie||133075]]. Cycle good gem cards such as [[Fearless Foodie||113154]] and buy good spells such as 3 pointy arrow spell. Eventually, buy [[Utility Drone||98588]] to capitalize on the magnetics you attached with Glambot in the midgame."
msgstr "场上有 [[Glambot||132893]] 时，尽可能多地对机械使用定向法术。[[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] 可以使这些法术的效果触发两次。最好拥有 [[Captain Cookie||133075]] 之类的法术生成组件。反复使用 [[Fearless Foodie||113154]] 等优质鲜血宝石卡牌，并购买“武器锻造”等优质法术来获取3张尖利箭矢。最后购买 [[Utility Drone||98588]]，利用中期通过微光机器人磁力吸附的大量组件获得进一步成长。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "[[Glambot||132893]] + [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]"
msgstr "[[Glambot||132893]] + [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "[[Glambot||132893]] to stabilize"
msgstr "用 [[Glambot||132893]] 稳定下来"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "Cast spells on Mechs"
msgstr "对机械施放法术"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Demons - Shop Buff"
msgstr "恶魔 - 商店强化"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Scale your shop with [[Devilish Distractor||132901]], best when paired with [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]. Then, your payoff for the buffed shop is most commonly [[Felboar||110664]], but it could also be [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]] and/or reborn [[Imp-lusionist||132899]]. Use [[Methodical Madness||132903]] spells on shops with Divine shield or Venomous to give these keywords to all your demons."
msgstr "使用 [[Devilish Distractor||132901]] 强化酒馆，最好搭配 [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]，让强化效果触发两次。酒馆获得大量强化后，最常见的收益组件是 [[Felboar||110664]]，也可以使用 [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]，或者获得了复生的 [[Imp-lusionist||132899]]。对酒馆中具有圣盾或剧毒的随从使用 [[Methodical Madness||132903]] 生成的法术，让你的所有恶魔获得这些关键词。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Buffed Shop ([[Devilish Distractor||132901]]) + [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"
msgstr "强化的商店([[Devilish Distractor||132901]]) + [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Scale and consume shop"
msgstr "强化并吞噬商店"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/37/
msgid "Elementals - Stat scaling"
msgstr "元素 - 属性成长"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/37/
msgid "Buff your stat scaling through either [[Moat Custodian||132981]] or early [[Glowing Cinder||119951]]. Then, if you have Manasurge, cycle every good elemental ([[Sellemental||64038]], [[Tavern Tempest||64077]], [[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]], [[Sand Swirler||119949]]). It's even better if you cycle those cards with [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]. The best elemental engine in the game is [[Kelp Keeper||132883]] + [[Tavern Tempest||64077]] or [[Gentle Djinni||64062]] if Murlocs are in. If your economy is really good you can add [[Unbound Tempest||132983]] while buffing the shop,"
msgstr "通过 [[Moat Custodian||132981]] 或前期获得的 [[Glowing Cinder||119951]] 建立属性成长。如果拥有狂放的法力涌流，就循环使用所有优质元素（[[Sellemental||64038]]、[[Tavern Tempest||64077]]、[[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]、[[Sand Swirler||119949]]）。如果能配合 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] 循环使用这些卡牌，效果会更好。鱼人开放时，游戏中最强的元素运转引擎是 [[Kelp Keeper||132883]] 搭配 [[Tavern Tempest||64077]] 或 [[Gentle Djinni||64062]]。如果经济非常充足，可以在强化酒馆的同时加入 [[Unbound Tempest||132983]]。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/37/
msgid "[[Unleashed Mana Surge||120674]] + [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + Stat scaling ([[Glowing Cinder||119951]])"
msgstr "[[Unleashed Mana Surge||120674]] + [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + 属性加成 ([[Glowing Cinder||119951]])"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/37/
msgid "[[Glowing Cinder||119951]] + Ele Midgame\n"
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"
msgstr "[[Glowing Cinder||119951]] + 元素中期过度\n"
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/37/
msgid "Buff stat scaling on Elementals."
msgstr "对元素的属性值进行强化。"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "Beasts - Summon Beetles"
msgstr "野兽 - 召唤甲虫"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "With early [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] or [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]], start scaling the stats of beetles. [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] can help you generate pieces of the comp with the help of [[Snarky Shark||132804]]. Run as many [[Banana Slamma||98824]] as possible, as they double the attack of your beetles and helps deals with high HP boards."
msgstr "前期获得 [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] 或 [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]] 后，开始提高甲虫的属性。[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] 可以配合 [[Snarky Shark||132804]]，帮助你生成阵容所需的组件。尽可能多地使用 [[Banana Slamma||98824]]，它们可以使甲虫的攻击力翻倍，帮助你应对高生命值阵容。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "Early [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] or [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]]"
msgstr "早期 [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] 或 [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]"
msgstr "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
